<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 1. </span>Left: Previously known results regarding Questions <a href="#S1.Thmthm1" title="Question 1.1. ‣ 1. Introduction ‣ On the Chow and cohomology rings of moduli spaces of stable curves" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">1.1</span></a> and <a href="#S1.Thmthm2" title="Question 1.2. ‣ 1. Introduction ‣ On the Chow and cohomology rings of moduli spaces of stable curves" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">1.2</span></a>. 
