<div id="S10.SS2.p3" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S10.SS2.p3.1" class="ltx_p">For <math id="S10.SS2.p3.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="n\geq 1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>≥</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">n\geq 1</annotation></semantics></math>, we get a diagram</p>
