<p id="S10.SS2.p3.2" class="ltx_p">For each <math id="S10.SS2.p3.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="i" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>i</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">i</annotation></semantics></math>, the composition <math id="S10.SS2.p3.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="a\circ b\circ\sigma_{i}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">∘</mo><mi>b</mi><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">∘</mo><msub><mi>σ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">a\circ b\circ\sigma_{i}</annotation></semantics></math> defines a map <math id="S10.SS2.p3.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{H}_{4,g,n}\to\mathbb{P}\mathcal{E}^{\vee}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℋ</mi><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>g</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">→</mo><mrow><mi>ℙ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℰ</mi><mo>∨</mo></msup></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{H}_{4,g,n}\to\mathbb{P}\mathcal{E}^{\vee}</annotation></semantics></math>. Informally, this is defined by sending a pointed curve to the image of the <math id="S10.SS2.p3.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="i" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>i</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">i</annotation></semantics></math>th marking under the Casnati–Ekedahl embedding. Taking the product of these maps for <math id="S10.SS2.p3.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="i=1,\ldots,n" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">…</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">i=1,\ldots,n</annotation></semantics></math> we obtain a diagram</p>
<table id="S10.E3" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td rowspan="0" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_left"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_left">(10.3)</span></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
